  "adaptations": [
    "HTML changes relative engine paths, inserts the in-memory demo bridge and cache query tags, sets the default blue palette, and loads the shared same-origin Codex sprite player.",
    "The iframe adapter adds 2px padding to preserve all native 15px panel border corners; the package chat.css/color-mode.css/chat-blue.css are unchanged.",
    "The empty privacy-note node remains for renderer history toggles but is permanently hidden by the website adapter; close/reopen copy is concise.",
    "The 0.4.04 renderer preserves native pointer/keyboard focus logic. Avatar activity additionally includes parent pause state and listens for qiuqiu-demo-motion; appearance forwards the third Codex pet descriptor unchanged.",
    "The 0.4.04 color-mode.js initializer preserves the HTML blue palette. The memory bridge supplies native (colorMode, appearance, uiTheme) callbacks and validates same-origin parent messages; only the two fixed website pet examples are accepted.",
    "The shared native Codex sprite player uses 0.4.04 idle timing (6.6s) and is loaded from ../customize/lib/codex-pet-player.js; its source and precise same-origin URL adaptation are recorded in ../customize/source-manifest.json.",
